{"id": "sdqa0007", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Manslaughter is usually a less serious form of homicide. It often involves situations where someone unintentionally causes the death of another person, or acts in a moment of heat or without full intent. Homicide generally refers to any unlawful killing, which can include both murder and manslaughter. So while all manslaughter is a type of homicide, not all homicides are considered manslaughter because they may involve premeditation or mal ice.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0015", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There are five permanent members of the United Nations Security Council. These countries are China, France, Russia, the United Kingdom, and the United States. They have permanent seats with veto power.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0023", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first Atlantic hurricane in 2000 was Hurricane Alex. It formed on May 31, 2 000, and it became the earliest- forming Category 4 hur ricane ever recorded at that time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0031", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Chechen language is a part of the Northeast Caucasian language family. It's spoken by the Chechen people, primarily in Chechn ya and parts of Russia, but also by some communities abroad. It' s important to note that while many speak it at home, Russian is often used for official purposes or in public settings.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0039", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "GDP stands for Gross Domestic Product. It's a measure of the total value of all goods and services produced within a country in a specific time period, usually a year or a quarter. It helps us understand the overall economic activity and health of a nation's economy.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0047", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Price Fighter series began in 1 98 7.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0055", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Omo River is approximately 7 50 kilometers, or about 4 6 6 miles long. It's the longest river in Ethiopia and a major tributary of the N ile, flowing through southern Ethiopia before joining the Blue Nile near Khartoum.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0063", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The current leader of Indonesia is Joko Widodo, often called Jokowi. He has been serving as President since October 20 14 and was reelected in 2 01 9 for a second term.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
